      "type": "bytes",
      "value": "[112, 114, 111, 112, 111, 115, 97, 108]"
    },
    {
      "name": "VOTE_SCALE",
      "docs": [
        "Votes are fixed-point with 9 decimals, so `1.5` votes is `1_500_000_000`."
